{"steam_appid":1709050,"steam_name":"Nitro Kid","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1709050/505505/23354523f7e670d4f1d1270ad4a17a2272c09de8/1751022239/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1666107612","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256911266/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1666107612","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/ss_00c7af029c7fab142091774f7313e01dfc89fff2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1739398923","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/ss_aaeedb6bcf8f4de77cf7421cbab6780e5518ea3d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1739398923","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/ss_2e4b326759d9f008f4cf99e06ac0b0e72793fbbb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1739398923","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/ss_431d7fd9066386c52627694a35f8bfa598a6bd81.1920x1080.jpg?t=1739398923","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/ss_ff07021e49f141031d3c7d505b9450b4b7bce20e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1739398923"],"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/d2dd1d1112a1833001c48f732eadb66b.poster.avif?t=1739398923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/d2dd1d1112a1833001c48f732eadb66b.webm?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/d2dd1d1112a1833001c48f732eadb66b.mp4?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ROGUELIKE DECKBUILDER MEETS GRID-BASED COMBAT</strong><br><br>– Craft a deck of synergized abilities, moves, and skills<br>– Slide around enemies, perform combos, and use the environment to your advantage<br>– Adapt your playstyle with card upgrades, game-changing infusions, and agent patches<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/06a4bc725b5f754fed7bd6ec5afe00b6.poster.avif?t=1739398923\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/06a4bc725b5f754fed7bd6ec5afe00b6.webm?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/06a4bc725b5f754fed7bd6ec5afe00b6.mp4?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>ORIGINAL SYNTHWAVE SOUNDTRACK</strong><br><br>30+ new tracks from the talents of the Synthwave and Darksynth genres.<br>Composed exclusively for Nitro Kid by:<br>- LudoWic (Katana Zero OST)<br>- Tonebox<br>- Jules Reves<br>- Laird Kruger<br><br>OST is available for purchase separately or in the Turbo Bundle with Nitro Kid.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/c5550aaa0feaa9fc6889d2c5e57e3e95.poster.avif?t=1739398923\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/c5550aaa0feaa9fc6889d2c5e57e3e95.webm?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/c5550aaa0feaa9fc6889d2c5e57e3e95.mp4?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>RETROFUTURE ESSENCE</strong><br> <br>It has everything we love about the 80’s with cyberpunk, retrowave, and classic action movie references. Can you catch all the easter eggs we hid?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/12c3b50bfb6d2a39ae018026480e3338.avif?t=1739398923\" width=576 height=215 /></span><br><strong>THREE UNIQUE AGENTS</strong><br><br>Pick your special agent. Every one of them has a unique set of cards, abilities, and playstyles.<br><br><strong>L33</strong> — Fluid fighter dedicated to martial arts and the power of the elements. <br>When Kung fu isn’t enough, you ignite in fury, burning enemies down (<i>quite literally</i>).<br><br><strong>J4X</strong> — Heavy-hitter thinking like a chess player. <br>Tank with the unique ability to counter-attack during enemy turns. Build up Combo and Pressure points for devastating knock-outs!<br><br><strong>K31</strong> — Professional assassin, the best at tech and weaponry.<br>Possessing two different stances for ranged and close combat. Each stance comes with unique perks and limitations. Use your ammo wisely!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/d8298e1911b63160c313d04c95244d6c.poster.avif?t=1739398923\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/d8298e1911b63160c313d04c95244d6c.webm?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/d8298e1911b63160c313d04c95244d6c.mp4?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>10 SECURITY LEVELS FOR A REAL CHALLENGE</strong><br><br>Every time you clear INFINITY tower – a new Security Level is unlocked.<br>Each of them brings tougher challenges your way. Will you make it to the mysterious <i>Creator</i>?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/eb95944393806246b2d9c41cce8307b8.poster.avif?t=1739398923\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/eb95944393806246b2d9c41cce8307b8.webm?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/eb95944393806246b2d9c41cce8307b8.mp4?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>NITRO KID FEATURES</strong><br><br>- 3 unlockable Agents<br>- 250+ Cards<br>- 3 unique Acts (stages of INFINITY tower)<br>- Security Levels for difficulty progression<br>- 50+ Unique Enemies<br>- 50+ Events<br>- 30+ Infusions<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/6780d28891aea00bca8d70b7cef81479.poster.avif?t=1739398923\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/6780d28891aea00bca8d70b7cef81479.webm?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709050/extras/6780d28891aea00bca8d70b7cef81479.mp4?t=1739398923\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"","genres":["Indie","Strategy"],"developers":["Wildboy Studios"],"publishers":["tinyBuild"],"release_date":"18 Oct, 2022"}